#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0227B expect=skipped domain=ADEFF
#note "No BDS indicator, no TERM/TRT/DECOD-suffixed column, no SPDEVID, and the name is not ADSL, so the structure set is [ADAM OTHER], which is in neither Include token -> out of scope, never runs, even though the data (a TRTSEQPN=1 tie) would fire if it did. This is the batch's ONE pin on the [SLAD, DLAD] Scope block, shared verbatim with AD0228B and AD0229B."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADEFF
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TRTSEQP  type=Char
col TRTSEQPN type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | A-B | 1
S1 | 002 | B-A | 1
